        "assigned_sentiment": "positive",
        "fragment_sentiment": "positive",
        "text": ": \"I am kind of a technological dinosaur and I needed support for EV things, like finding an electrician to put a plug in my garage, signing up with ElectrifyAmerica for the free electricity that comes with the car, and learning how commercial charging stations work",
